# Helix output modes

Canonical modes: `auto`, `chart`, `grid`, `analytical_report`, `analytical_report_chart`.
Aliases: `analysis` / `research` → `analytical_report`; `both` → `analytical_report_chart`.

`_package_result` must keep:

| Mode | text_report | grid | echarts_option |
|------|-------------|------|----------------|
| analytical_report | required | null | null |
| grid | null | required | null |
| chart | null | null | required |
| analytical_report_chart | required | optional | required |
| auto | required | optional | optional |

Chart types stay in `VALID_CHART_TYPES`. Build charts from SQL fetch rows only (`build_echarts_option` / `build_grid`).
